Article 40: Types of Measures

The educational measures, the surveillance measures, the protection measures and the assistance measures are the following:
1.	handing-over of the minor to his/her parents; his/her guardian; to a person who has guardianship role or to another person who is trustworthy.
2.	handing-over of the minor to a social service agency charged with handling of minors;
3.	handing-over of the minor to a private organization who has the qualification to receive them;
4.	handing-over of the minor to a specialized hospital or institution;
5.	placement of the minor under the judicial protection.

