Article 342: Aggravating Circumstances

The offence specified in Article 341 (Obscene Acts on a Minor of Less Than 15 Years of Age) is punishable by an imprisonment from 2 (two) years to 5 (five) years and a fine from 4,000,000 (four million) Riels to10,000,000 (ten million) Riels, when it is committed:
1.	by an ascendant;
2.	by a person who has an authority over the minor;
3.	by several persons acting as the perpetrator, co-perpetrators, the instigator or the accomplice;
4.	by payment of remunerations.

