The blackmail is an act of obtaining, by means of threatening to disclose or to impute facts so as knowingly to ruin a person's honour or friendship:
1.	a signature;

2.	a commitment or a renunciation;
3.	the disclosure of a secret;
4.	the delivery of funds, of assets or any property.

