text:
CHAPTER 2 INSULTING THE KING

Article 445: Insulting the King

Insulting the King is punishable by an imprisonment from 1 (one) month to 6 (six) months, and a fine from 100,000 (one hundred thousand) Riels to 10,000,000 (ten million) Riels, when it is committed:
1.	by speeches, of any kind whatsoever, pronounced in a public place or in any public meeting;

2.	by writing or sketches, of any kind whatsoever, distributed in public or exposed to the sights of the public;

