Sub-Section 1 Delivering of Briberies

Article 605: Delivering of Briberies

It is punishable by an imprisonment from 5 (five) years to 10 (ten) years for an unauthorised person who directly or indirectly delivers present or gift, makes promise or give interests to a civil servant or a citizen entrusted with public mandates through an election so that the latter:
